H1: Forex Brokerage Technology Infrastructure
From the outside, a brokerage looks like a website and a trading app. Underneath, it's a chain of systems working together every second the market is open. Trading servers. Price feeds. Bridges and FIX sessions. A CRM. Payment and verification tools. Monitoring, security and backups holding it all up.
This section explains the forex brokerage technology we work with, how each layer fits into the whole, and what it means for running a brokerage day to day. If you're comparing providers or planning your own stack, it's a good place to start.
